# Environment variables for gassafetyfrontend.
# Phase 1 uses none of our own. Copy to .env.local for local work; never commit real values.
#
# Read automatically on Vercel (no action needed), used by /version.json:
#   VERCEL_GIT_COMMIT_SHA  - commit being built (Preview, Production)
#   VERCEL_ENV             - "preview" or "production"
#
# Phase 2 will add (secret, server-only, Preview and Production):
#   SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY, RESEND_API_KEY
